      "summary_en": "Graves' shotgun has some unique properties. He must reload when he runs out of ammo. Attacks fire 4 bullets, which cannot pass through units. Non-champions struck by multiple bullets are knocked back.",
      "summary_zh": "格雷福斯的散弹枪拥有一些独特性能。他的弹药打光后就必须重新装弹。每次攻击会发射4颗弹丸，弹丸无法穿透单位。会击退被多颗弹丸命中的非英雄单位。",
